This fixture pins `Asset.absLink()` (issue #25): `$site.asset('og.png')` is
referenced ONLY through `.absLink()` in the layout's `og:image` meta tag, so
if `absLink()` failed to bump the same install refcount as `.link()`, the
asset would be silently pruned from the output tree.
